<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AI JobCoach</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>
    <%- include('partials/authButtons') %>
    <main class="jobcoach-page">
        <section>
            <h2 class="panel-title">What is JobCoach?</h2>
            <p>
                AI JobCoach is an interactive platform that empowers students to upload their resumes, cover letters, and job descriptions to receive real-time, AI-powered feedback. Powered by Gemini AI, our tool provides constructive insights into your strengths and areas for improvement, along with an overall compatibility score to help you understand how well your documents align with your target role — so you can put your best foot forward, every time.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="panel-title">Our Mission</h2>
            <p>As students ourselves, we understand the challenges of breaking into the workforce. Our mission is to empower fellow students with the tools and guidance they need to turn their ambitions into careers.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="panel-title">Meet the Team</h2>
            <p>Daniel Acosta, Victor Santana &#x1f1e9;&#x1f1f4;, Xander Humphreys, Ethan Buhman</p>
        </section>
    </main>
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>